{
  "branches": {
    "jump-eba12380162765fd": [
      {
        "player": "What is this place?"
      },
      {
        "npc": "This is our home. In your tongue, it is known as Mount Karuulm."
      },
      {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": [
          {
            "text": "My tongue?",
            "steps": [
              {
                "player": "My tongue?"
              },
              {
                "npc": "Yes. You speak the language of humans but we Kahlith have our own language."
              },
              {
                "npc": "In the past, we have tried to teach our language to your kind. However, despite the simplicity of our tongue, success was limited."
              },
              {
                "npc": "We find that it is easier to just use your language when your kind are around."
              },
              {
                "type": "choice",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "text": "Kahlith?",
                    "steps": [
                      {
                        "type": "jump",
                        "id": "-VdWv8",
                        "steps": [
                          {
                            "type": "call",
                            "branch": "jump-eefca008d6f91a9e"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Can you give an example?",
                    "steps": [
                      {
                        "player": "Can you give an example?"
                      },
                      {
                        "npc": "Of our language?"
                      },
                      {
                        "player": "Yes please."
                      },
                      {
                        "npc": "Well you'll find our language is quite a simple one. Our names are a good example of how it is used."
                      },
                      {
                        "npc": "I am Xorrah quo Sihar. The first word, 'Xorrah', is unique to me and it is how I can be identified."
                      },
                      {
                        "npc": "The second word, 'quo', is a basic Kahlith word that translates to 'the' in your language."
                      },
                      {
                        "npc": "The final word, 'Sihar', is my title. There are four possible titles, one for each role in Kahlith society. My title translates to 'Mystic' in your tongue."
                      },
                      {
                        "player": "So in my language your name would be Xorrah the Mystic?"
                      },
                      {
                        "npc": "Exactly."
                      },
                      {
                        "player": "Interesting. Thanks for the information."
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "end"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "That's all thanks.",
                    "steps": [
                      {
                        "type": "jump",
                        "id": "DWrzeC",
                        "steps": [
                          {
                            "type": "call",
                            "branch": "jump-aa6a2968de0e7e6b"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Who are you?",
            "steps": [
              {
                "type": "jump",
                "id": "gLy5Ej",
                "steps": [
                  {
                    "type": "call",
                    "branch": "jump-87c0f031f311eb00"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "That's all thanks.",
            "steps": [
              {
                "type": "jump",
                "id": "ImtXeV",
                "steps": [
                  {
                    "type": "call",
                    "branch": "jump-aa6a2968de0e7e6b"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "jump-aa6a2968de0e7e6b": [
      {
        "player": "That's all thanks."
      },
      {
        "type": "end"
      }
